#
# The plan: a sort over a vectorized scan, the whole island in Rapid.
# EXPLAIN does not say which sort runs -- the operator and MySQL's
# filesort print the same node -- so the counter below is what
# distinguishes them.
#
SET SESSION use_secondary_engine = FORCED;
EXPLAIN FORMAT=TREE SELECT i, d FROM t1 ORDER BY d, i;
EXPLAIN
-> Sort: t1.d, t1.i  
    -> Vectorized table scan on t1 in secondary engine Rapid  

Warnings:
Note	1003	Query is executed in secondary engine; the actual query plan may diverge from the printed one
